{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は個別でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝落ちして\n更新遅くなってしまいました..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/30/2313165/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私服"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/30/2313165/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"猫耳、チョーカー、ワンピ\n全て one spo"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/30/2313165/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪型"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1～3部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ワンカール"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/30/2313165/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4・5部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんちゃってボブ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/30/2313165/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/30/2313165/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会話"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマスライブ\nサンエト、らじらー\n沈金 晋平太さん\nコスプレ\nちー様\nブランコ\nタンバリン\nサントスさん\nラップ\n生ドル 神宿さん、欠席、カナヲ\n16th30部\nうたコン\nヨシヒコ\n真夏の全国ツアー、神宮\nゴルフ\n株\n宿題\nアイドル\nブログ、モバメ、755\netc."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先週ぶりということもあって\n話題ないかなーと思ったけど\n意外と結構あって\n改めて良い1週間だったんだなあ\nと再認識しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/30/2313165/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、今だから言うけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前日にゴボウの土落としてたら\n指汚くなって\n酢につけたりして頑張って落としたんだけど\n全部は落ちきらなかったせいで\nちょっと指が黒かったです実は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな状態で握手してごめんなさい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/30/2313165/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん、来てくださって\nありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/30/2313165/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日のらじらーに\nサンエトで出演させていただきます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんと！\nサンエトの新曲を解禁しちゃいます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/30/2313165/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「君に贈る花がない」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"期待してていいです\n中田のすごく好きな曲です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな聴いてね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/30/2313165/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/30/2313165/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10月30日（日）20:05〜放送 NHKラジオ第1「らじらー！SUNDAY」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}